==English==

===Etymology===
Originally a medieval variant of {{m|en|Jack}}, and jake derived from {{m|en|John}}; today also used as a diminutive form of {{m|en|Jacob}} and {{m|en|James}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/d͡ʒeɪk/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|eɪk|lang=en}}

